[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p><p>1. Open the ashtray and undo the screws.</p><p>2. Move the ashtray over slightly.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Cigarette lighter/power socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891067\">P50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Dashboard power socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891071\">P51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035888.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ashtray is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Fit ashtray in its seating.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>Check that the cigarette lighter, ashtray\nlight and power socket on the dashboard are working.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892179\">7040A77</a></p>"]]